From: Benji Charles <charles.benji33@gmail.com>
Date: Fri, 30 Oct 2026 22:00:26 -0400
Subject: [PATCH] Buy Brightline x DSA: unify spacing, headings, buttons and
 flow

- One section rhythm and fluid side gutters (bb-sec, bb-wrap, bb-gutter)
- One section-title style (bb-h2) and one orange pill button (bb-pill)
- Hero sized to the screen
- Upcoming events strip on the landing page, swipeable on phones
- Testimonials swipe on phones, arrows on desktop
- Closing We need you! banner; slim footer
- Shared 28px corner radius on cards and images

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01HtisU6XdgEXpAv646VhqJ8
